  m_text: 'GOATS

    Place goats on empty points. After all 20 are placed, move
    one connected point. Trap all four tigers to win.


    TIGERS

    Move along
    connected lines. Jump over a goat into the empty point beyond it to capture.
    Capture five goats to win.


    AI

    Choose your side and set the difficulty
    before playing.'
